{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 52695, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 41065, "uid": 35890, "type": 4, "title": "萌新100问（编辑中）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1599108629, "updated_at": 1668930380, "updated_uid": 57172, "comment_at": 1680504147, "last_at": 1683393078, "comment_count": 96, "status": 1, "summary": "因为小弟我也不算大佬，所以此贴如果有任何有问题的地方希望大家指出。本文章面向刚入坑萌新哦。另外还有哪里不懂的萌新可以加群：930267486，这个群萌新挺多的，气氛融洽的鸭皮。1：为什么这个游戏的画风", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/2020/1599115506_274-161101125538.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599115750385_10245935.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599188624605_89045626.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 68, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 155652, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 54, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 52695, "content": "<br><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80); font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;\">因为小弟我也不算大佬，所以此贴如果有任何有问题的地方希望大家指出。</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80); text-decoration-line: underline;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">本文章面向刚入坑萌新哦。</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>另外还有哪里不懂的萌新可以加群：<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">930267486</span>，这个群萌新挺多的，气氛融洽的鸭皮。</div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">1：为什么这个游戏的画风如此油腻且瑟情？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">油腻是因为这个游戏是由<span>剑灵美术总监的绘师金亨泰作出的手游。剑灵听说过吧，油腻大师姐的那种。瑟情是因为这个游戏是R18，懂的都懂。<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/2020/1599115506_274-161101125538.png\" alt=\"萌新100问（编辑中）\" data-width=\"630\" data-height=\"420\"></span><div><span><br></span></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">2：那要怎么下载这个游戏呢?</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">ios丶安卓丶模拟器：<a href=\"http://destinychild.gamekee.com/50010.html\">点击进入下载页面</a><div>其中ios的只有和谐的，并且ios下载还要买一个韩服成人认证的appstore的id，淘宝价格大约在50左右。</div><div><br><div><br></div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">3: &nbsp;为什么我进不去游戏啊？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">1：可能游戏在维护。<div>如下图，这种情况就只有等了。</div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599115750385_10245935.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599115750385_10245935.png\" alt=\"萌新100问（编辑中）\" data-width=\"750\" data-height=\"1624\"></div>2：可能是是加速器问题，或者是谷歌四件套没有下载完成，如下图。</div><div>推荐加速器有免费的biubiu或者是<a href=\"http://destinychild.gamekee.com/50010.html\">腾讯加速器</a>。</div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599188624605_89045626.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599188624605_89045626.png\" data-width=\"548\" data-height=\"977\"></div><br></div></div></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">4：我看不懂韩文怎么办呢？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">目前汉化就是酔游汉化：<a href=\"http://destinychild.gamekee.com/50010.html\">酔游汉化详情</a><div>其实嫌贵的话，可以去群里看看翻译或者是咸鱼找一下。</div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">5：天子是什么东西？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">天子就是这个游戏里的角色，你的老婆。<div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599125805779_73894300.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599125805779_73894300.png\" data-width=\"554\" data-height=\"975\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599125810188_64007375.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599125810188_64007375.png\" data-width=\"555\" data-height=\"319\"></div><br><div><br><div>天子分为5星，4星，3星，2星，1星。并且可以升星到6星。</div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">:6：升级好慢啊，怎么快速升级？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">想要快速升级，你可以刷图或者喂经验天子，长的有点像史莱姆。<div>另外需要注意的是，那个头顶上有max的史莱姆，慎用，这个可以把天子直接提到满级，建议在5星升6星的时候用。<br><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599126205126_8887861.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599126205126_8887861.png\" style=\"height: 385.172px; width: 211.188px;\" data-width=\"579\" data-height=\"936\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599126468148_99175876.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599126468148_99175876.png\" style=\"height: 389.297px; width: 212.188px;\" data-width=\"585\" data-height=\"936\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">这些史莱姆，主要路径就是通过材料本获取，材料本进入方法如下。（里面除了刷经验狗粮，还能刷升星用的材料以及金币）</div><div class=\"div-img\">还有就是通过活动等途径获取的箱子<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599126610650_98828177.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599126610650_98828177.jpg\" style=\"height: 444.859px; width: 380.188px;\" data-width=\"544\" data-height=\"926\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599126724037_650706.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599126724037_650706.png\" data-width=\"526\" data-height=\"111\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">7：前期该如何获得5星天子呢？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">第一种方法就是抽卡，点主界面的这个标志进入<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599127177565_56553082.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599127177565_56553082.png\" style=\"height: 72px; width: 75px;\" data-width=\"99\" data-height=\"108\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">前期建议萌新可以抽这个卡池，因为这个卡池出5星的概率是最大的，有5%，但是一天只能抽一次，其他的卡池的概率都只有0.9%要不就是3%。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599127337466_20171134.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599127337466_20171134.png\" data-width=\"561\" data-height=\"394\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">然后就是通过参与一些活动（比如Raid）我来获得5星天子的劵。</div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">8：我想要成为氪金大佬，我该怎么充值啊？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">如果你想要氪金，可以直接淘宝搜索天命之子充值，建议去可以提供回执和销量高的店铺充值，比如skip或者哇喔手游这些店。<div>提一句，本人感觉，除了大小月卡，其他都没什么好氪的。<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/152152.html\" target=\"_blank\">氪金攻略点击这里</a></div></div></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">9：皮肤这么好看，要怎么获得呢？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">这个游戏的皮肤可以通过皮肤塔获得，怎么进入？看下图。<div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599128193149_13798593.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599128193149_13798593.jpg\" data-width=\"576\" data-height=\"930\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">建议打皮肤塔之前，去加一些大佬，然后白嫖他们的天子。</span></div><br></div><div>另外可以通过活动，获得一些皮肤或者皮肤箱子。</div><div><br></div></div></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">10：我们活动该做什么？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">现在的活动无非就是raid和WB以及翻牌等等。<div>raid：这个对于萌新来说比较困难，如果实在是打不出1%的伤害，可以去群里加一些斩车佬，或者先升级自已的车然后把自已的车扔进杀手池里，会有免费的工具人帮忙打。</div><div>WB：就是世界Boss,做这个活动只需要一有挑战次数就进图，等到活动结束，能拿的基本也全能拿到了。<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599129906200_67343411.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599129906200_67343411.png\" data-width=\"201\" data-height=\"136\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">翻牌，不用多说，基本就是白给，只要每天推推图，基本就能拿到全部奖励了。</div><div class=\"div-img\">另外还有一些<span>PVP试炼丶以及升星活动的活动就不说了，可以再主界面的左边看到。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599130379377_65609477.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599130379377_65609477.png\" style=\"height: 179px; width: 144px;\" data-width=\"131\" data-height=\"205\"></div><br></span></div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">11：不想氪金的话获得钻石的渠道有哪些啊？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/161028.html\" target=\"_blank\">DC全游资源获取途径点击这里</a></div></div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">12：点火什么什么意思呢？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">点火就是强化角色的一种形式，让你的角色变的更强些。<div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599190258225_36871815.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599190258225_36871815.png\" data-width=\"283\" data-height=\"69\"></div><br><div>角色点火过后星星就会变成红色（需要注意的是，只有达到了6星，60级，100%好感才能点火）。</div></div><div><br></div><div>如果想要点火，就需要制作点火核心，制作材料可以通过商城丶pvp奖杯交换丶活动获取等等。其实有时候活动可以直接换取核心，如果你是萌新，前期建议不要搞点火，对于萌新来说太废资源了。<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599190784278_88288420.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599190784278_88288420.png\" style=\"height: 368px; width: 188px;\" data-width=\"465\" data-height=\"736\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599190784281_26500255.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599190784281_26500255.png\" style=\"height: 367.516px; width: 211.188px;\" data-width=\"537\" data-height=\"534\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,182,79,0.7);font-size:13.9999px;\">点火石获取途径点击这里</span></div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13.9999px;\">13：</span>怎么提高练度？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/157898.html\" target=\"_blank\">点击这里</a></div>\n                               </div></div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">14：地铁是什么东西啊？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">就是一个每日副本，可以获得装备丶金币丶原石等等。<div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599195564205_51350301.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599195564205_51350301.png\" data-width=\"228\" data-height=\"179\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">这个建议每天刷一次，因为算在每日任务里的。</div><br></div></div></div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">15：该怎么样选择装备啊?</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">这个游戏的装备，除了5星A级的，其他都没必要升级。那多余的装备怎么办？建议用来升级5星A级装备。<div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599196138545_14958431.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599196138545_14958431.png\" data-width=\"340\" data-height=\"499\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">当然也要注意装备的属性，不能随便乱给。</div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/80674.html\" target=\"_blank\">装备节奏榜</a></div></div></div><div><br></div></div></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">16：为什么我温泉里的天子都有雾挡着啊？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">温泉是算是这个游戏的一个特色，这个游戏除了普通的皮肤之外，还有温泉皮肤，只有解锁了温泉皮肤，迷雾才会散开。<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599196280209_42858150.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599196280209_42858150.png\" data-width=\"504\" data-height=\"452\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">温泉皮肤可以通过百鬼夜行<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599196331862_50629006.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599196331862_50629006.png\" data-width=\"92\" data-height=\"91\">获取，也可以通过活动获得。</div></div></div><div><br></div></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">17：为啥我每次打开物品会出现把宝物出售获得金币，要点吗？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281139192_9602464.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281139192_9602464.png\" data-width=\"517\" data-height=\"232\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">点就行了，留着也没用。</div></div></div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">18：为什么有些天子可以装灵魂宪章，有些不行？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">想要装灵魂宪章，就必须先把天子的好感拉到100%。<div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281266555_1480650.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281266555_1480650.png\" data-width=\"339\" data-height=\"154\"></div><div><br></div><br></div></div></div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">19：天子满出来了怎么办？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">随便点击一个天子，再点击<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281325815_45337990.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281325815_45337990.png\" style=\"height: 54px; width: 95px;\" data-width=\"182\" data-height=\"67\">这个图标，就可以分解天子了。<div>PS：分解的时候还是要注意下，别点的太快把5星的给分解了。</div></div></div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">20：为什么获得的皮肤不能用？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">点击物品<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281686919_38438995.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281686919_38438995.png\" data-width=\"94\" data-height=\"104\">，然后是服装栏<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281712774_61688843.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599281712774_61688843.png\" data-width=\"73\" data-height=\"70\">,去里面解锁。</div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">21：自动攻击应该怎么选啊。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">如图，选<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599389223901_3460761.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599389223901_3460761.png\" data-width=\"117\" data-height=\"104\">这个，full auto。</div></div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">22：手机玩一会就发热很严重，不能长时间挂机咋整啊？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">有3个选择&nbsp;<div>1：可以话大价钱买一部好手机（当我没说）。</div><div>2：可以用手机模拟器在电脑上挂机。这里推荐雷电模拟器（因为自带谷歌 ，而且可以多开），直接百度下载最新版即可。</div><div>3：可以用红手指也就是云手机挂机。</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/153165.html\" target=\"_blank\">增加流畅度点击这里</a></div></div></div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">23：大佬们口中的好用的嫦娥到底是哪个？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\">这2个。（Ps：木嫦娥（图1）必须点火后才好用&nbsp; 不点火就是库管&nbsp; 萌新前期不用练这个）&nbsp;<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599447805787_86974250.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599447805787_86974250.png\" data-width=\"539\" data-height=\"839\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599447809047_60677536.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599447809047_60677536.png\" data-width=\"532\" data-height=\"755\"></div></div></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n            <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n            <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">24：有些卡池过了真的就没了吗？</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">一般对策卡池(也就是限定抽活动天子的卡池）过了之后会到一般卡池中<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599447941324_57208177.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599447941324_57208177.png\" style=\"height: 137.266px; width: 271.547px;\" data-width=\"557\" data-height=\"388\">所以不用担心一会不会有了。<div><br></div><div>当然除了<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">联动卡池</span>以外，这个游戏的优先度联动卡池大于任何卡池，因为过了就没有了。</div><div>至于哪个卡池是联动，那就要多多关注下天命之子韩服的wiki公告。</div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">25：为什么有些灵魂宪章是闪烁的。</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">闪烁的灵魂宪章<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599839502719_91447652.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599839502719_91447652.png\" data-width=\"100\" data-height=\"102\">比普通的属性要稍微高一点。这种就是普通的<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599839564406_43382833.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599839564406_43382833.png\" data-width=\"96\" data-height=\"91\">。<br><br><div><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/96710.html\" target=\"_blank\">魂卡值不值得练点击这里</a></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">26：温泉要泡吗？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">那必须要泡一下，因为泡温泉也是增强角色的一种方式。<div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599839836973_60273135.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599839836973_60273135.png\" data-width=\"452\" data-height=\"611\"></div></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">27：一个天子有很多相同的温泉皮肤有什么用吗？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">使用温泉皮肤的话可以获得灵气。然后去温泉对应的天子那边点<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1601394885835_47141316.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1601394885835_47141316.png\" data-width=\"407\" data-height=\"71\"><div>把灵气全部交出去，就可以升级了。<br><div><br></div></div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">28：附魔是什么东西？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">附魔就是给装备附上属性，属性有E,D,C,B,A,S.<div>建议在双倍附魔的时间段附魔。<br><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604043043113_98207794.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604043043113_98207794.png\" style=\"height: 216px; width: 227.976px;\" data-width=\"533\" data-height=\"505\"></div><br><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/87997.html\" target=\"_blank\">附魔图鉴和简评点击这里</a></div></div></div>\n                               </div></div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">29：在Raid的商店中，写着2700钻石刷新商店，需要刷新吗？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">非常需要，这比你一次11发要赚非常非常多。<div>可以获得各种属性五星卷等奖励。<br><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604043205834_66904518.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604043205834_66904518.png\" data-width=\"469\" data-height=\"590\"></div><br></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div><br></div><div><span><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">30：什么是挖矿？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\">这个游戏有一个机制，就是天子升满级就可以拿钻石，6星满级拿60钻石，5星拿50钻石，以此类推。所以可以拿一些低星天子去探险，很快就能拿钻石，或者是翻牌本或者双倍经验的时候也可以练一些天子。<div>PS:升满级或者的钻石会通过邮箱发放。</div></div>\n                               </div></span></div><div><div><br></div><span><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">31：没有足够的五星天子来升6星怎么办？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\">这里强行建议不要用5星去进阶5星，我以前刚入坑的时候就不小心把一些有用的天子给当升星材料了，后来才追悔莫及。<div>这游戏4星进阶来的5星天子也可以用于5星升6星。所以像我这种咸鱼玩家，就会把一些1级的4星天子放探险，这样的话大概1个活动周期不到就可以拿到一堆胎五，再也不用愁升不了6星了。<span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307050676_16064030.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307050676_16064030.png\" data-width=\"391\" data-height=\"197\"></div></span></div></div>\n                               </div></span></div><div><div><br></div><span><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">32：raid活动中什么叫车？车怎么刷出来？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\">在RAID活动中，玩家只要刷剧情本<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307225649_25787243.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307225649_25787243.png\" style=\"height: 68px; width: 73.1908px;\" data-width=\"141\" data-height=\"131\">或者活动本<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307239080_31992743.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307239080_31992743.png\" style=\"height: 76px; width: 80.3678px;\" data-width=\"92\" data-height=\"87\">以及raid商店中的召唤卷<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307764617_45578237.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307764617_45578237.png\" style=\"height: 84px; width: 56px;\" data-width=\"150\" data-height=\"225\"><br>。都可以刷新出BOSS<img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307653468_52987033.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608307653468_52987033.png\" style=\"height: 177.172px; width: 100.177px;\" data-width=\"553\" data-height=\"978\">。一开始出现的车会是1级，需要自已参与击杀，如果自已不参与让好友给击败了车就不会升级，下次召唤出来还是1级。自已击杀不了可以放杀手池或者请求好友bang助，只有击败30级的车才会有几率开出铂金箱，只有铂金箱才有可能拿到皮肤或者五星天子等。<br><br><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/53131.html\" target=\"_blank\">详情点击这里</a></div>\n                               </div></span></div><div><div><br></div><span><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">33：啥是点火呀？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\">当你的天子已经60级以后就可以开启点火，开启之后星星会变成红色，这会大大增加你的天子的强度。<div><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1618282823403_72219907.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1618282823403_72219907.png\" data-width=\"269\" data-height=\"109\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">ps:第一次点火用到的点火时极为重要，后面几个全是狗粮，所以在第一次点火时一定要慎重选择一块好的点火石。</div></span><br></div></div>\n                               </div></span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">34：听说有一张点火石的表格？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/95715.html\" target=\"_blank\">点击这里</a></div></span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">35：大佬说的买体力是什么意思？</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\">就是无限开金币宝箱omo<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625323254989_48440999.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625323254989_48440999.png\" data-width=\"238\" data-height=\"343\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">36：有没有涩涩的语音呢？（不再更新了）</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">日服语音包</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">链接: https://pan.baidu.com/s/1Vat93AssujDPhGstaTjUsg&nbsp;</div><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提取码: <span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">4piq</span></span><br></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;min-height:1px;\">来自：很难相处</div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">37：RD白金箱子出货率看图</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636218468185_40371434.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636218468185_40371434.png\" data-width=\"371\" data-height=\"751\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">38：<span style=\"\">天子好多，哪些天子有用？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/154546.html\" target=\"_blank\">点击这里</a></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">39：<span style=\"\">最强的队伍搭配是什么，可以一个队秒天秒地秒空气吗？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">本游戏有属性克制，BOSS还有各种控制，所以没有最强的队伍搭配<br style=\"\">这游戏最少要配日常队+PVP队+RD队+WB队<br style=\"\">觉得麻烦的话，最少也要配日常队和RD队（五系即五队）<br style=\"\">各队伍的具体配置站内都有详细攻略<br style=\"\">PS 顶配队伍确实可以跨属性5系斩，但是当你能跨属性斩的时候，你已经不满足于跨属性斩了，因为打的太慢啦</span></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">40：<span style=\"\">我卡主线了，咋办？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">首先考虑属性克制，主线的怪也是有各种属性的。<br style=\"\">其次加强天子的属性，具体怎么加强我后面在写。<br style=\"\">PS 主线的怪不是越往后越强的，从2-几开始（具体我记不清了额，应该是第二幕）开始，后面的怪突然变得很弱，但是经验是越来越多的。所以想办法打过去，开后面的主线图，可以方便练级哦</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">41：<span style=\"\">萌新怎么加强天子</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">1.升到60级 <br style=\"\">2.好感全开 <br style=\"\">3.武器防具用+15的 <br style=\"\">4.提升魂卡等级加值<br style=\"\">4.点火<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">其他像搞天子加值，装备附魔，玩偶这些慢慢玩都会有的，上面是最快最基础的。<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">PS 点火要慎重。点火石/红石是唯二两个，不存在溢出的资源，且都很难获得，要好好用哦。（反过来说金币玛瑙体力，萌新大胆用，浪费一点也没事）<br style=\"\">萌新可以点火个三星火达比（全部天子都是她带大的，劳模），完事以后所有点火石都留给RD天子</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">42：<span style=\"\">游戏活动好多，都要参加吗？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">最简单来说，其实这游戏就三个活动<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">1.RD 必参加 拿5星天子的<br style=\"\">萌新发车就行了，具体怎么搞可以看站内的攻略，很详细<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">2.WB 随便 奖励中规中矩，分全服奖励（你打不打都有），和个人伤害排名奖励（这个很看练度，急不来）<br style=\"\">大佬用来秀练度的，萌新可以无视或者拿墨丘利上去混伤害<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">3.翻牌 建议参加 用来刷附魔石和升级魂卡的枕头的<br style=\"\">不难，打不过2-8就打2-5，尽量凑到60%的加成再打</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">43：什么程度可以斩车？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">斩车看综合练度的<br style=\"\">大概来说，就是当你该点火的都点火了（不用都点满，要点到什么程度站内有攻略哦），平均加值+2左右，附魔什么也大概搞一搞就能斩啦<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">PS 纯发车 一期大概能拿80个五星天子券/80个5A装备券（取决于你好友的斩车速度以及灵车概率）<br style=\"\">     发斩    一期大概能拿120个五星天子券/120个5A装备券（取决于你的斩车速度）<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">     最快凑出斩车队伍的方法：<br style=\"\">1.用各种自选箱把刀的加值先搞刀+6，辅助有就行，加值随意<br style=\"\">2.给刀凑各种+攻的附魔（站内有附魔推荐），武器附魔3洗出吸血，以及+5的加攻魂卡，总之就是刀尽量高配，这直接决定你伤害是不是够斩车<br style=\"\">3.辅助尽量堆肉，主要靠防具二号位的减伤附魔（这个全队都要优先弄）以及血防魂卡</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">44：<span style=\"\">我金币/钻石/玛瑙不够怎么办？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">钻石萌新推图都会给，每日也会给<br style=\"\">金币主要是等300%金币的活动（现在就有，建议买2次），一期活动大概可以拿8000万。还有RD的斩史莱姆<br style=\"\">玛瑙分解史莱姆就有</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">45：<span style=\"\">推完图好多钻石，怎么用？新天子出来抽不抽？各种池子抽不抽？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">新天子，如果可以用来打RD的可以抽，其他就不太建议了，具体可以看新天子出来后的评测<br style=\"\">5%的池子可以抽，其他就不建议了，血亏<br style=\"\">钻石刚推完图看上去很多，实际大概也就支持3期左右的发斩，如果要点火的话那更不够了，所以还是建议不要乱用哦（钻石最高效的用法是买RD的斩车门票和点火）</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">46：<span style=\"\">进化材料不够咋办？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">铁匠铺是可以分解进化材料的（5星分解给四星，四星分解给三星这样的）<br style=\"\">5星材料可以在PVP商店和推图的商店里买<br style=\"\">PS 当初不知道铁匠铺可以分解，各种凑低星进化材料，泪目</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">47：<span style=\"\">天子格子要开吗？物品栏要开吗？开到什么程度？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">开！大胆开，早晚要开的，开到什么程度都行，反正放不下就开</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">48：<span style=\"\">自选号要不要搞一个？氪金性价比怎么样？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">个人觉得自选号没必要，这是个养成游戏，慢慢玩就行，自选号的钻石你自己推完图也有，天子发几期车也都有了。而且开科技过图的自选号之前封过一批，自选号有风险哦~<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">这个游戏氪金不会让你立即变得很强（除非你氪很多~~），如果0基础的号，氪完金还是被吊打T T<br style=\"\">当然不是说氪金没用，而且各种活动福利太好~如果你要支持DC或者想小氪一点，大/小月卡是性价比最高的~总结来说，氪金只是锦上添花~</span></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">49：<span style=\"\">我想变强！但是不想那么肝，有办法吗？</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"\">长期玩，强度党建议搞个辅助哦，24小时发斩，翻牌都很方便~<br style=\"\">辅助的话加各种群，免费的收费的都有的，自由选择即可~</span></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/2020/1599115506_274-161101125538.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599115750385_10245935.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1599188624605_89045626.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 35890, "username": "冰菓", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/21.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 14, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 3, "content_at": 95978552, "content_num": 28, "read_num": 178974, "like_num": 87}, "update_user": {"uid": 57172, "username": "雪", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1007/h_1600/215/57172/2026/0/7/717949.jpg", "description": "\n", "follow_num": 9, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "su